        "filing_date": "2025-11-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Close customer relationships influence all aspects of our business: from our broad range of product portfolios and application expertise to manufacturing capabilities in high-performance power management and precision and high-speed signal processing technologies.",
        "start_character": 2328,
        "end_character": 2592
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000006281-25-000153",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000006281-25-000153-b32f540296d9b2d5",
        "accession_number": "0000006281-25-000153",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer a variety of web-based tools that ease product selection and aid in the design process for our customers.",
        "start_character": 16085,
        "end_character": 16212
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000006281-25-000153",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000006281-25-000153-b32f540296d9b2d5",
        "accession_number": "0000006281-25-000153",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In certain cases, because we have already developed the core technology platform for our general-purpose products, we can create application-specific solutions quickly and efficiently.",
        "start_character": 7697,
        "end_character": 7881
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000006281-25-000153",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000006281-25-000153-b32f540296d9b2d5",
        "accession_number": "0000006281-25-000153",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In fiscal 2025, we also launched Power Studio, a digital simulation and design ecosystem integrating new system-level and IC-level design capabilities into a single product family.",
        "start_character": 14335,
        "end_character": 14515
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000006281-25-000153",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000006281-25-000153-b32f540296d9b2d5",
        "accession_number": "0000006281-25-000153",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In other instances, we manufacture product based on forecasts of customer demand.",
